    "ASK RCF ENGLISH - the answers the site guide gives.",
    "",
    "This is NOT an AI. It is a keyword matcher over these written answers,",
    "with the site search index behind it as a fallback. That is deliberate:",
    "a real AI assistant needs an API key, and a key shipped in a static site",
    "is public the moment it is published.",
    "",
    "Every 'url' below must be a real page. Run tools/check-assistant.js after",
    "editing - it checks every link against the built search index and fails",
    "if one does not exist. A broken link here is invisible to the build's own",
    "link checker, because these links are written by JavaScript at run time.",
    "",
    "'must' = at least one of these words has to be in the question.",
    "'any'  = each of these that matches adds to the score.",
    "Keep answers short. The links do the work."
